, "1": "it"}}, {"is": {"0": "is", "1": "is"}}, {"essential": {"00": "crucial", "01": "vital", "10": "indispensable", "11": "fundamental"}}, {"to": {"0": "to", "1": "to"}}, {"encourage": {"00": "motivate", "01": "inspire", "10": "urge", "11": "prompt"}}, {"and": {"0": "and", "1": "and"}}, {"empower": {"00": "enable", "01": "authorize", "10": "equip", "11": "strengthen"}}, {"youth": {"00": "youngsters", "01": "juveniles", "10": "young people", "11": "young adults"}}, {"to": {"0": "to", "1": "to"}}, {"participate": {"00": "take part", "01": "join in", "10": "get involved", "11": "engage in"}}, {"in": {"0": "in", "1": "in"}}, {"politics": {"00": "governance", "01": "statecraft", "10": "diplomacy", "11": "political science"}}, {"and": {"00": "plus", "01": "along with", "10": "together with", "11": "as well as"}}, {"make": {"00": "create", "01": "craft", "10": "formulate", "11": "produce"}}, {"their": {"0": "one's", "1": "its"}}, {"voices": {"00": "opinions", "01": "perspectives", "10": "viewpoints", "11": "expressions"}}, {"heard": {"00": "listened to", "01": "acknowledged", "10": "noticed", "11": "recognized"}}], "container": "Youth participation in politics is crucial for the development of a democratic society. It is important for young people to get involved in political processes and decision-making as they have unique perspectives and ideas. When youth engage in politics, they contribute to the formation of policies that directly affect them. Furthermore, their participation ensures that the needs and concerns of the younger generation are adequately addressed. By actively participating in politics, young people can take ownership of their future and shape the world they want to live in. Therefore, it is essential to encourage and empower youth to participate in politics and make their voices heard.", "encoded_message": "Teens involvement in governance is essential for the progress of a representative public. Such is significant for budding persons to become participatory in administrative procedures and determining as they have singular viewpoints and notions. At the time when young ones participate in statecraft, they give to the structuring of rules that expressly influence them. Also, their activity secures that the wants and matters of the younger generation are adequately addressed. By actively participating in politics, young people can take ownership of their future and shape the world they want to live in. Therefore, it is essential to encourage and empower youth to participate in politics and make their voices heard.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 3.14, "secret_key_generation": 82.87}, "decoding_time": 0.0003750324249267578, "decoded_message": "1000000110001010011010000010001010010110100101111010011011011101", "error_message": ""}